WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
Welcome to the AI Confidence Academy.

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:04.360
Thank you for stopping by.

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:09.040
You may have heard a great deal about
artificial intelligence—and still be

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:11.920
wondering, “What does any of this have to
do with my life?”

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:17.400
That is a reasonable question. AI is
becoming part of the systems we encounter

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:22.360
at work, the applications we use, and the
digital spaces where we

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:24.020
find information and communicate.

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:27.480
You do not have to follow every new
development.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:32.880
But learning a few fundamentals can help
you understand these tools and decide

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:34.560
how they might serve you.

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:36.800
Start with something familiar.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.320
Perhaps you have a letter to write,

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:42.060
but you are having trouble finding the
words.

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:47.960
You know what you want to say. AI can help
you organize your thoughts into

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:50.620
a first draft—one you can read, correct,

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:55.620
and make your own. Perhaps you are trying
to understand an unfamiliar subject.

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:59.100
You can ask for an explanation in plain
language.

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:02.280
If it is still unclear, you can say,

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:04.320
“Give me an everyday example,”

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:07.840
or, “Let’s go through that one step at a
time.”

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:10.400
You can ask follow-up questions.

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:12.260
You can set the pace.

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:17.640
If you are organizing a busy week, AI can
help you break a large task into

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:22.540
smaller steps. If you are considering a
business idea, it can help

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:26.120
you outline your thinking, identify
questions to research,

00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:27.920
or prepare a checklist.

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:32.400
In the workplace, it can assist with
drafting, planning, and organizing

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:37.340
information. At home, it can help you
explore ideas, prepare

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:42.040
for a conversation, or work through a
project you have been putting off. These

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:43.720
are practical places to begin.

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:46.960
And beginning does not require becoming a
technical expert.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:52.500
The fundamentals include learning how to
explain what you need, provide useful

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:55.060
context, ask a clearer question,

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:57.700
and recognize when an answer needs
checking.

00:01:58.280 --> 00:01:59.540
That last part matters.

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:02.120
AI can give you a useful response.

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:07.460
It can also misunderstand you, leave
something out, or sound certain

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:09.340
about information that is wrong.

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:13.500
Learning how to use it includes knowing
what to question

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:18.940
and what information to keep private. At
ACA, we say: AI

00:02:18.940 --> 00:02:21.240
assists. Humans verify.

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:24.760
Your experience and judgment remain
essential.

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:29.100
You bring the purpose. You decide whether
the assistance is useful.

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:34.620
AI is already part of everyday life, and
there is good reason to

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:36.340
prepare for its continuing role.

00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:41.560
You can begin calmly, with one useful task
and room to practice.

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:45.620
That is the invitation here at the AI
Confidence Academy:

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:49.240
come with your questions. Build your
understanding.

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:51.700
Discover where these tools can help you.

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:56.840
People come first. AI is the tool.
Confidence is the product.

00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:02.280
Thank you for spending a few minutes with
us. We invite you to explore the Academy,

00:03:02.980 --> 00:03:04.900
and we look forward to welcoming you back.

